---
title: Timers
description: A small test recipe with one kind of timer in each step.
course: side
icons: [carrot, oven, potato]
---

Roast the @potatoes{1%kg} for ~roast{20%minutes}.

Roast the @carrots{500%g} for ~roast{30-40%minutes}.

Simmer the @stock{1%l} for ~simmer{10%minutes}.

Let the vegetables rest for ~rest{30%seconds}.

Whisk the @cream{1%cup} for ~whisk{30%seconds}.

Chill the cream for ~chill{8-16%hours}.

Cook the @onions{2} for ~cook{5-6%minutes}, then add the @garlic{2%cloves} and cook for ~cook{1%minute}.

Rest the potatoes for ~rest{30%seconds}, then roast them again for ~roast{20%minutes}.

Serve everything with @salt{}.
